      "cooked": "<p>Hello all,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><br><div><span>I'm currently rocking a 800ct card box with colored note cards as dividers. &nbsp;I currently have the 1st edition SotM, Rook City exp, IR exp, and Ambuscade promo deck [which fits perfectly in an 800ct]; however, I have on order Shattered Timelines with all the other promos (Unity, Scholar, 2 eniv., Ms. Info) so I need to upgrade.</span></div><p>I was wondering if anyone has made custom vertical dividers for a separate (Shoebox 1600ct) card box? &nbsp;<span>I have found horizontal homemade dividers but not vertical ones...</span><span>wish I was crafty enough to make them -- though I might try my hand at it if I get no response here. &nbsp;I was thinking it would be sweet to have the name on top (obviously) and either picture (like the ones I've seen horizontally) OR have some minor bio regarding the heros/villians/enviornment [some basic info]</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I guess I can use tuck boxes -- but I like dividers for some odd reason</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:47.889Z",
